    <item>
      <title>Gordon champions Wyoming’s responsibility for elections as Gray gives voter info to feds</title>
      <link>https://www.wyomingpublicmedia.org/politics-government/2026-02-05/gordon-champions-wyomings-responsibility-for-elections-as-gray-gives-voter-info-to-feds</link>
      <description>Asked about the secretary of state’s decision to give the feds a statewide voter registration list, the governor said, “ I believe strongly both in our country's Constitution, which delegated the responsibility for elections to the states, and our state's Constitution, delegating that down to the county clerks.”</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wyomingpublicmedia.org/politics-government/2026-02-05/gordon-champions-wyomings-responsibility-for-elections-as-gray-gives-voter-info-to-feds</guid>
